{
  "caveats": [
    "These are historical survey indices ending in 2019, not current poverty estimates. The older and updated poverty lines cannot be joined into one unchanged series. Poverty-gap and squared-gap indices measure different aspects of poverty and must not be added together. The source prints the 2019 estate-sector old-line poverty gap as 1,2; its decimal comma was reviewed as 1.2, with the original token retained.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
  ],
