    "DCS Household Income and Expenditure Survey poverty-gap and squared-gap indices for 2012/13, 2016 and 2019, nationally and by urban, rural and estate sector. The older line is based on HIES 2002 and adjusted with CCPI. The updated line is based on HIES 2012/13 and adjusted with NCPI for 2019. Both line definitions are retained as separate observations."
